{
  "work_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm",
  "source_path": "titus-paul-cd/phlm.json",
  "source_language": "oge",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.1",
      "source_sha256": "4151e6d43aa869ce",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Paul, a prisoner of Christ Jesus, and Timothy the brother, to Philemon, our beloved and fellow worker,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "e367979eab0d260f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and to Apphia, the sister and beloved, and to Archippus, our fellow soldier, and to the congregations of your house."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.3",
      "source_sha256": "3fbea2e4fbcef845",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "d27b764efc8442ab",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I thank my God always, and I make remembrance of you in my prayers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.5",
      "source_sha256": "c882691a89a718c7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I hear of that love and faith of yours, which you have toward the Lord Jesus Christ and toward all the saints,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.6",
      "source_sha256": "1d536ba964e34bcd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that the fellowship of your faith may be helped by the knowledge of every good thing that is among us toward Christ Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.7",
      "source_sha256": "c26063cc052fe9ad",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For I have great joy and consolation because of your love, for the hearts of the saints have been refreshed through you, brother. 2"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.8",
      "source_sha256": "4e554afd0314a6fb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Therefore, though I have much boldness in Christ to command you what is fitting,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.9",
      "source_sha256": "6e5584264bcabe02",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for love's sake I rather beseech you, being such a one as this: Paul, an old man, and now also a prisoner of Christ Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.10",
      "source_sha256": "dc62f5c1d827a7bb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I beseech you for my child, whom I begot in bonds, Onesimus,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.11",
      "source_sha256": "fe8dd732aaf5bdef",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who was once useless to you, but now is useful to me and to you, whom I have sent to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.12",
      "source_sha256": "bade1309bc8e1e1e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And you, receive him, that is, my own heart,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.13",
      "source_sha256": "e748a22341db47ad",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whom I wished to keep with me, so that in your place he might serve me in these bonds of the gospel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.14",
      "source_sha256": "8703e3d45bed38cf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But without your knowledge I did not wish to do anything, so that your good deed might not be unwilling, but willing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.15",
      "source_sha256": "5fb51eaa7032aeff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Who knows, perhaps it was for this reason that he was parted from you for a time, so that you might receive him forever,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.16",
      "source_sha256": "8a372784b2f6a65a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "no longer as a slave, but more than a slave, a beloved brother. Since he is so to me, how much more to you, both in the flesh and in the Lord!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.17",
      "source_sha256": "9475bf08542adf5f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you have counted me a partner, receive him as you would me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.18",
      "source_sha256": "76e9dab1a90902b8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And if he has wronged you in anything or owes you anything, charge that to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.19",
      "source_sha256": "1393a2e99270bbb4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I, Paul, have written with my own hand: I will repay it; so as not to say to you that you owe me even your own self."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.20",
      "source_sha256": "7b3b7c785b1a7660",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Yes, brother, I have gained you through the Lord; refresh my heart in Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.21",
      "source_sha256": "4bc45828d39148c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Trusting in your obedience I have written to you, knowing that what I am telling you, you will indeed do."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.22",
      "source_sha256": "a061c2aad08f6eed",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And along with that, prepare a lodging for me as well, for I hope that through your prayers I will be granted to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.23",
      "source_sha256": "6afea6bdf40efd78",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Epaphras, my fellow captive in Christ Jesus, greets you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.24",
      "source_sha256": "e486defa2c0a31d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as do Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, and Luke, my fellow workers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-cd/phlm#Phlm.1.25",
      "source_sha256": "e7b65b1110344733",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with your spirit. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
